{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pinball Crush is a cozy GBA inspired pinball game with a dating sim progress system. Hit specific targets to access cutscenes and events with your date. There are 300+ unique events to explore, so you'll always have something new!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683910/extras/18e7c58802b918d607f9fed44eace6f0.avif?t=1753294766\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683910/extras_big/18e7c58802b918d607f9fed44eace6f0.avif?t=1753294766 width=800 height=322 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a flipper fling - bounce around Cupid's Garden and all the local spots to gain points, upgrade your ball, and find new ways to play.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683910/extras/c97ac977b410bb666c8bd77360bc9e59.avif?t=1753294766\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683910/extras_big/c97ac977b410bb666c8bd77360bc9e59.avif?t=1753294766 width=800 height=212 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with and romance up to 6 NPCs on dates to the movies, library, cafe, and more, including collectathons, trivia, and good vibes.\u00a0Even the chipmunks like it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683910/extras/55f8e46b55fbdbed2ce511d2485360f0.avif?t=1753294766\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683910/extras_big/55f8e46b55fbdbed2ce511d2485360f0.avif?t=1753294766 width=800 height=436 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(we spent like two weekends making this chipmunk sized pinball machine. look how cute :3 )</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Credits</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pinball Crush has a blend of original and unedited CC0-CC3 music! If you enjoy the tunes, check out the amazing musicians below!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Bus Stop&quot; by Kevin McLeod </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Kawai Kitsune&quot; by Holizna Radio</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Turkey's Song&quot;, &quot;Shorewood&quot;, and &quot;Chippy Chipmunk&quot; by Joe</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All sound effects are from the Gamemaster Audio - Pro Sound Collection</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pinball Crush will run on the Steamdeck, but may require the device to be in controller mode, or in certain cases per-game controller remapping.\u00a0</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Catherine Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3683910/4eefe06a724825992663391372e9f508c8407844.jpg"},{"name":"Ned Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3683910/bbb576ea1e10e424d34d015b2040d4bc525c929b.jpg"},{"name":"Fishing Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3683910/bc68af23fd3282b80556b5b1d703fb2bf34cc9dc.jpg"},{"name":"Heath Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3683910/7f625422975fbd1dab534d85bb2ae7f93d5b3d20.jpg"},{"name":"Eliana Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3683910/881a2f0a1015f01aa3e074afc10ecec0d1fb9dbf.jpg"},{"name":"Piston Completed! WOOO!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3683910/078ae4a6238d7274f91fed6f30379169d27e7996.jpg"},{"name":"First Cafe 